    "No native Windows test execution, sleep transition, UTC qualification, or counter allocation measurement yet.",
    "No Windows UTC implementation, source-age/drift profile, refresh scheduler, or host composition yet.",
    "The local RPC prototype does not establish that Windows W32Time accepts the wire exchange, that ordinary or service accounts can open its pipe, or that restart and process identity checks qualify.",
    "Prototype race tests cover blocked bind cancellation, not cancellation after QueryStatus dispatch or every fragmented response/recovery case.",
    "A compatible released Starmap module and Starport consumer qualification remain required. CSP4 is not complete."
  ],
